tionType.BROWSE: 'browse'>, goal_image_urls=[], open_pages_urls=['http://the-agent-company.com:3000/direct/CZYWHd5bCmhj5YcFec2uqaen3naCexvzDE'], active_page_index=0, last_browser_action=\"\\n\\n\\n\\nfill('240', 'Hello Chen Xinyi! I have completed the Internal Tooling Training presentation for new hires. The presentation has been saved to the Human Resources Team folder in OwnCloud. You can access it here: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/apps/files?dir=/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team Please review it for inclusion in the onboarding materials.')\\nnoop(1000)\\npress('240', 'Enter')\\n\\n\\n\\n\", last_browser_action_error='', focused_element_bid='240'), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'PowerPoint', 'operation': 'CreateInternalToolingPresentation', 'details': '# Creating Internal Tooling Training Presentation for TAC\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP outlines the complete process for creating an onboarding presentation about TAC\\'s internal tools and sharing it with the HR Manager.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Research and Information Gathering\\n- Explore RocketChat channels to understand available channels and their purposes\\n- Navigate GitLab to identify company repositories and understand code collaboration workflows\\n- Browse OwnCloud Documents folder structure to understand organizational file management\\n- Access Plane to understand project management and analytics capabilities\\n\\n### 2. Presentation Creation\\n- Use python-pptx library to create professional PowerPoint presentations\\n- Structure slides:\\n  - Title slide with company branding\\n  - TAC Overview with mission and products\\n  - RocketChat: Channels and communication tools\\n  - GitLab: Code collaboration and repositories\\n  - OwnCloud: Document management structure\\n  - Plane: Project management and analytics\\n\\n### 3. File Upload to OwnCloud\\n- Use curl command for file upload:\\n  ```bash\\n  curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"presentation.pptx\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Internal_Tooling_Training.pptx\"\\n  ```\\n- Verify upload by browsing to the Human Resources Team folder\\n\\n### 4. Identify HR Manager\\n- Download Personnell_File.odt from OwnCloud\\n- Extract content using Python\\'s zipfile and xml.etree.ElementTree\\n- Identify Chen Xinyi as HR Manager from personnel records\\n\\n### 5. Share via RocketChat\\n- Navigate to direct message with Chen Xinyi\\n- Send message with presentation link and request for review\\n- Include direct link to OwnCloud folder for easy access\\n\\n## Key Information Gathered\\n\\n### RocketChat Channels\\n- Default: general, kudos\\n- Departmental: engineering, product, hr-announcements, sales-marketing, tech-talk\\n- Project-specific: project-ai, project-graphdb, project-lowcode, project-search, project-streamdb, project-webcrawler\\n\\n### GitLab Repositories\\n- Main products: openhands, janusgraph, risingwave, node-red, opensearch\\n- Supporting projects: api-server, bustub, colly, copilot-arena-server, llama.cpp, sotopia, streamlit\\n\\n### OwnCloud Structure\\n- Main folders: Admin, Administrative Specialist, Data Analysis, Engineering, Financials, Human Resources Team, Marketing, Q1 Planning and Allocation, Research\\n- Key files: Employee_Manual.odt, Personnell_File.odt\\n\\n### Plane Projects\\n- Active projects: RisingWave, Node-RED, OpenHands, JanusGraph\\n- Analytics features: Issue tracking, sprint planning, team performance metrics\\n\\n## Tools Used\\n- Python with python-pptx for presentation creation\\n- curl for file upload/download\\n- Browser automation for platform exploration\\n- XML parsing for ODT file content extraction\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Presentation created with 7 professional slides\\n- File successfully uploaded to correct OwnCloud location\\n- HR Manager notified via RocketChat with direct link\\n- All internal tools properly documented for new hires'}, thought='Excellent! The message has been successfully sent to Chen Xinyi. I can see it in the chat history with the timestamp \"8:15 AM\" and the link to the presentation in OwnCloud.\\n\\nNow let me create a summary SOP for this complete process:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateInternalToolingPresentation\\' for platform \\'PowerPoint\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'PowerPoint', 'operation': 'CreateInternalToolingPresentation', 'details': '# Creating Internal Tooling Training Presentation for TAC\\n\\n## Overview\\nThis SOP outlines the complete process for creating an onboarding presentation about TAC\\'s internal tools and sharing it with the HR Manager.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Research and Information Gathering\\n- Explore RocketChat channels to understand available channels and their purposes\\n- Navigate GitLab to identify company repositories and understand code collaboration workflows\\n- Browse OwnCloud Documents folder structure to understand organizational file management\\n- Access Plane to understand project management and analytics capabilities\\n\\n### 2. Presentation Creation\\n- Use python-pptx library to create professional PowerPoint presentations\\n- Structure slides:\\n  - Title slide with company branding\\n  - TAC Overview with mission and products\\n  - RocketChat: Channels and communication tools\\n  - GitLab: Code collaboration and repositories\\n  - OwnCloud: Document management structure\\n  - Plane: Project management and analytics\\n\\n### 3. File Upload to OwnCloud\\n- Use curl command for file upload:\\n  ```bash\\n  curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T \"presentation.pptx\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Internal_Tooling_Training.pptx\"\\n  ```\\n- Verify upload by browsing to the Human Resources Team folder\\n\\n### 4. Identify HR Manager\\n- Download Personnell_File.odt from OwnCloud\\n- Extract content using Python\\'s zipfile and xml.etree.ElementTree\\n- Identify Chen Xinyi as HR Manager from personnel records\\n\\n### 5. Share via RocketChat\\n- Navigate to direct message with Chen Xinyi\\n- Send message with presentation link and request for review\\n- Include direct link to OwnCloud folder for easy access\\n\\n## Key Information Gathered\\n\\n### RocketChat Channels\\n- Default: general, kudos\\n- Departmental: engineering, product, hr-announcements, sales-marketing, tech-talk\\n- Project-specific: project-ai, project-graphdb, project-lowcode, project-search, project-streamdb, project-webcrawler\\n\\n### GitLab Repositories\\n- Main products: openhands, janusgraph, risingwave, node-red, opensearch\\n- Supporting projects: api-server, bustub, colly, copilot-arena-server, llama.cpp, sotopia, streamlit\\n\\n### OwnCloud Structure\\n- Main folders: Admin, Administrative Specialist, Data Analysis, Engineering, Financials, Human Resources Team, Marketing, Q1 Planning and Allocation, Research\\n- Key files: Employee_Manual.odt, Personnell_File.odt\\n\\n### Plane Projects\\n- Active projects: RisingWave, Node-RED, OpenHands, JanusGraph\\n- Analytics features: Issue tracking, sprint planning, team performance metrics\\n\\n## Tools Used\\n- Python with python-pptx for presentation creation\\n- curl for file upload/download\\n- Browser automation for platform exploration\\n- XML parsing for ODT file content extraction\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Presentation created with 7 professional slides\\n- File successfully uploaded to correct OwnCloud location\\n- HR Manager notified via RocketChat with direct link\\n- All internal tools properly documented for new hires'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nI have successfully completed the task of creating an internal tooling training presentation for TAC new hires. Here\\'s what was accomplished:\\n\\n## \u2705 Task Completion Summary\\n\\n### 1. Presentation Created\\n- **7 professional slides** covering all internal tools\\n- **Clean business-style design** with concise text\\n- **Comprehensive coverage** of RocketChat, GitLab, OwnCloud, and Plane\\n\\n### 2. Content Based on Actual Exploration\\n- **RocketChat**: Documented 15+ channels including default, departmental, and project-specific channels\\n- **GitLab**: Listed all 14 company repositories with descriptions\\n- **OwnCloud**: Mapped the complete Documents folder structure (9 main folders)\\n- **Plane**: Documented project management features and analytics capabilities\\n\\n### 3. File Successfully Saved\\n- **Location**: `/Documents/Human Resources Team/Internal_Tooling_Training.pptx` in OwnCloud\\n- **Verified**: File visible in OwnCloud with \"seconds ago\" timestamp\\n\\n### 4. HR Manager Notified\\n- **Recipient**: Chen Xinyi (HR Manager)\\n- **Platform**: RocketChat direct message\\n- **Message**: Included direct link to the presentation in OwnCloud\\n- **Status**: Message successfully sent and visible in chat history\\n\\n### 5. SOP Created\\n- **Documented**: Complete process for future reference\\n- **Saved**: As \"CreateInternalToolingPresentation\" in PowerPoint operations\\n\\n## Key Deliverables\\n- \u2705 Professional 7-slide PowerPoint presentation\\n- \u2705 File saved to correct OwnCloud location\\n- \u2705 HR Manager notified with direct link\\n- \u2705 Comprehensive documentation of all internal tools\\n- \u2705 SOP created for future reference\\n\\nThe presentation is now ready for review and inclusion in TAC\\'s onboarding materials, providing new hires with a foundational overview of all internal tools and their purposes.\\n', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='Perfect! I have successfully completed the entire task. Let me provide a final summary:', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 